---
// Footer.astro - Schiefer-Anthrazit Footer im Nordic Editorial Tech Design
---

<footer class="bg-nordic-slate-900 text-white border-t border-white/10 pt-16 pb-12 mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      
      <!-- Spalte 1: Profil & Mission (5 Spalten) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white">
            <span class="text-sm">FL</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight block">Fabian Lutz</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-nordic-emerald-400 block">Digital Business & AI</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          M.Sc. Digital Business. Spezialisiert auf agentische KI-Workflows, Enterprise-Systeme (SAP), Business Analytics und praxiserprobte Qualitäts-Governance (GAMP 5).
        </p>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-nordic-emerald-400"></span>
          Sofort verfügbar für Remote & Hybrid
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Spalte 2: Navigation & Bereiche (4 Spalten) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
          Portfolio Navigation
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li>
            <a href="#hero" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none">
              Startseite & Positionierung
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#experience" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none">
              Berufserfahrung & Meilensteine
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#skills" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none">
              Skill- & Tech-Stack-Matrix
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#projects" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none">
              Case Studies & Leuchtturm-Projekte
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#philosophy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none">
              Philosophie & Zielrollen
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#about" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none">
              Über Fabian Lutz & Kurzprofil
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Spalte 3: Direkter Kontakt & Rechtliches (3 Spalten) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
          Kontakt & Rechtliches
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
          <p>
            <a href="mailto:lutzfabi2@gmail.com" class="hover:text-nordic-emerald-400 transition-colors font-medium">
              lutzfabi2@gmail.com
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs pt-1">
            72488 Sigmaringen, Baden-Württemberg
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="open-impressum-btn text-left text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none py-1"
          >
            Impressum (DDG § 5)
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="open-datenschutz-btn text-left text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded outline-none py-1"
          >
            Datenschutzerklärung (DSGVO)
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <p>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Fabian Lutz. Entwickelt mit Astro v5 & Tailwind CSS. 100% cookie-frei.
      </p>

      <a
        href="#hero"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nordic-emerald-500 rounded p-1 outline-none"
      >
        <span>Nach oben scrollen</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 15l7-7 7 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
